  Forms:
  - DisplayName: Young Serpent
    PlanIndex: 0
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 3337.7, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 1912.1
    Line: The brood knots into a young serpent. It is hungry.
  - DisplayName: Serpent
    PlanIndex: 1
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 5224.2, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 2191
    Line: The serpent grows longer. Burn what it means to eat.
  - DisplayName: Great Serpent
    PlanIndex: 2
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 7594.4, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 2743
    Line: A great serpent now. One more meal and it will change.
  - DisplayName: Bull
    PlanIndex: 3
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 15509.9, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 3166.2
    Line: The coils fold. A bull flies where the serpent was. It is gathering itself for the dance.
  - DisplayName: Lord of the Dance
    PlanIndex: 4
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 1
    Line: The ring of fire lights round the Lord of the Dance. Put out the flames before the drum stops.
  - DisplayName: Winged Lion
    PlanIndex: 5
    FillToEvolve: 0.9
    BankToEvolve: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
    MealVolume: 1
    Line: 'The drum stops. A winged lion rises out of the fire, trailing flame. Only this form can pass the membrane.'
  SealMargin: 60
  SealHold: 60
  StarveStandoff: 140
