  TransitionFlash: 1.5
  RestoreSeconds: 5
  StartLine: Something in the reef remembers the old shapes.
  HeadingForExitLine: The route is eaten. It turns back to forage what you left.
  StarvingLine: Nothing left to eat. It presses on the membrane and starves.
  ReadyToDanceLine: The Bull has eaten enough. It rises into the Lord of the Dance and turns for the dance ground.
  SealedLine: The membrane holds. Only the final form can pass.
  FirstFlameLine: 'A flame is out. Put out {1} and the dance is broken.'
  LastFlameLine: '{0} of {1}. One flame more!'
  EscapedLine: The Winged Lion crosses the membrane. The cycle ends too soon.
  WonLine: The swarm is gone. The reef keeps its turn.
  DanceBrokenLine: The dance is broken. The reef keeps its turn.
  NudgeThreshold: 25
  NudgeFraction: 0.2
  MaxNudge: 6
